# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
# Real static files (launcher pages, /assets, /icons, manifest, etc.) are served
# directly — Pages matches an existing asset before applying this rule. Every
# other path is an app/marketing route resolved at runtime in RootRouter
# (e.g. /early-access, /invite, /about, /download, /home), so serve index.html
# with a 200 and let the SPA boot and route. Without this, direct navigation to
# those paths returns the 404 page — which is why the signup links were dead.
/*    /index.html    200
